    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2 data-start=\"4552\" data-end=\"4580\">Level 10 — <strong data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4580\">Quiet Mind</strong></h2><p data-start=\"4582\" data-end=\"4597\">You deny panic.</p><h3 data-start=\"4599\" data-end=\"4621\">Mechanical Effects</h3><p data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4650\">You and allies within 2 squares:</p><ul data-start=\"4651\" data-end=\"4752\"><li data-start=\"4651\" data-end=\"4687\"><p data-start=\"4653\" data-end=\"4687\">Are immune to being <strong data-start=\"4673\" data-end=\"4687\">Shaken</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"4688\" data-end=\"4752\"><p data-start=\"4690\" data-end=\"4752\">reroll the lowest die on checks vs charm, confusion, or morale effects</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4754\" data-end=\"4769\">At <strong data-start=\"4757\" data-end=\"4768\">Burn 3+</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4852\"><li data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4852\"><p data-start=\"4772\" data-end=\"4852\">You may spend your reaction to cancel one fear or charm effect affecting an ally</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4854\" data-end=\"4875\">Escalation dies here.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
